      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEALLY (2) got back ot winning ways last start over 1760m here when sticking on to score by 0.3L. Lucy Fiore hops on board now and the rise in trip doesn't look an isue on what we've seen from her recently. Improved nicely last time and she can build on that effort. OMERTA GRACE (1) finished behind IDEALLY last time out when 0.9L behind him there in a solid performance. He jumped in the market there and stepping out to this trip now doesn't look a problem on what we've seen lately. He can sit handy today and put his best foot forward. JAYASHREE (3) gets Faithfull back on board today after getting back and never featuring behind IDEALLY. It's her first time out to this trip, but she looks well placed on the back of her latest effort and her best form is good enough to get the job done here. THE CANDY KID (6) won't be far away. ROCKIN' ROBIN (5) is next best.",
